   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Deep Research / Evidence"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "97208487-801b-4edc-baab-664a6a00c8c9",
   "type": "heading_3",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "FACT"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "317aa60b-c09c-474d-8ce9-0c61e0088654",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "GitHub officially supports creating a repository for the authenticated user through POST /user/repos; fine-grained tokens require repository-creation write or administration write permission. This proves platform capability, not availability through the current connector. GitHub REST documentation"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d98b84f4-ca0c-4279-952c-49c5d5dc7610",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "GitLab supports creating a new project through its Projects API and through git push, subject to namespace/project-creation permission. GitLab Projects API GitLab project creation"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d7910dce-5e9d-45f1-b4af-4170bd0fb596",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Bitbucket Cloud provides an API endpoint to create repositories. Bitbucket repository API"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "25a96f7c-82d4-4f09-a95c-252399f1789b",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The current GitHub connector exposes repository read/write operations but does not expose a repository-creation action. This is a tool-surface fact, not a claim about the user's account-level GitHub permissions."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "bffab3be-7ecf-4046-bb46-c5696c80fd61",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Current Render live state confirms the queue is Free with persistenceMode=off; the Postgres state store is Free and temporary with expiry 2026-10-25."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0814a79d-e6a9-410e-9945-d6601f9f8438",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Cloudflare Workflows remains a candidate for durable orchestration, but it is not implemented or connected to this Central Runtime."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "1208f1a0-667e-40ab-84bf-48ece783851e",
   "type": "heading_3",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "EVIDENCE"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "640049e8-8140-4ced-bdac-51a4edbb9cbd",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Live GitHub connector state and live Render connector state were directly read in this cycle."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "e3f4fb9c-de64-41fb-8ece-2f1c2f2292a8",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent provider documentation confirms multiple technically valid repository-creation paths, but none is currently an authorized executable path through the connected GitHub tool surface."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "807c5ae2-c007-4d14-960e-f6d5678291e8",
   "type": "heading_3",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "INTERPRETATION"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c75f2f36-85c7-4427-a6d6-b5a5855520f1",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The blocker remains access/execution path, not lack of technically valid repository technologies. Therefore creating more runtime logic in an existing business repository would be an architectural violation and is not attempted."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "6bcc01f9-4b3e-4dbe-ae1f-1392bf06c883",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent Alternatives"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "e23d520a-2e3f-4c1c-9ae5-a8002d883ece",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent GitHub Repository + Cloudflare Workflows — strongest current orchestration candidate after isolation."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "4d317171-7f0f-49af-9b85-e9ae8a60d51c",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent GitLab Project + independent execution plane — viable repository alternative, but no connected GitLab creation path is verified."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "e9ef6790-d2a4-4853-8704-b46929de7f2e",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent Bitbucket Repository + independent execution plane — viable repository alternative, but no connected Bitbucket creation path is verified."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9b29c932-e3e9-4d6b-93d8-1178bdba748c",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent Repository + self-owned Control Plane + PostgreSQL + Worker — strongest fit for explicit Persistent State, Durable Queue, Lease/Ownership, Idempotency, and Recovery, but requires authorized production compute/storage."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "75d05d24-e009-4dc8-a565-23517170732a",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Decision"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c04f72c8-9abc-4005-ada5-d05d04c23796",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "KEEP REPOSITORY ISOLATION GATE."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "16c2b8a0-32be-4ae7-ac39-648f1614cd82",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not use Umm-sara, main, or umm-sarah-web as Central Runtime infrastructure."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d3d1be88-417f-4241-bca3-605c897e2a57",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not create or upgrade paid resources without verified authorization."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "f8bc90ac-d12c-4b03-ac46-03a47513e43e",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not attempt repository creation through an unsupported or guessed connector action."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T22:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "130ad30b-f8d0-4c6b-b8ed-96f75913fbe6",
